      "updated": 1787964802648,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.Questions\n    1.1 Is this a Mobile App or Web App or Both..?\n    1.2 Important Feature -- A user can publish and see her friends post on the new feedPage\n    1.3 Feed is sorted -- feed should appear in any order..?\n    1.4 How many friends can a user have -- 500\n    1.5 Traffic Volumne -- 10 million DAU\n    1.6 what does the feed contains? - Text,Image,Videos..",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Questions\n    1.1 Is this a Mobile App or Web App or Both..?\n    1.2 Important Feature -- A user can publish and see her friends post on the new feedPage\n    1.3 Feed is sorted -- feed should appear in any order..?\n    1.4 How many friends can a user have -- 500\n    1.5 Traffic Volumne -- 10 million DAU\n    1.6 what does the feed contains? - Text,Image,Videos..",
