    {
      "id": "d3b8R08wN9iNpd6CtN4_P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4182.008818934668,
      "y": 1730.340229051806,
      "width": 1198.3792724609375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 536948756,
      "version": 770,
      "versionNonce": 119564052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787967495516,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fanout on Write\n    - Pre Computing the feed during write time\n    - new post is deliverd to friends cache immediately after it is published\n    - Pros\n        - Fetching is fast beause it is precomputed\n    - cons\n        - If users have too many frnds generating the feed for all of them are slow and time consuming --> HotKey Problem.\n        - for inactive users or for those who rarely log in pre computing new feeds waste computing resources",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fanout on Write\n    - Pre Computing the feed during write time\n    - new post is deliverd to friends cache immediately after it is published\n    - Pros\n        - Fetching is fast beause it is precomputed\n    - cons\n        - If users have too many frnds generating the feed for all of them are slow and time consuming --> HotKey Problem.\n        - for inactive users or for those who rarely log in pre computing new feeds waste computing resources",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NjU7WhfXKmMnQgmH9Z_tt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4189.831351843728,
      "y": 2001.961270596199,
      "width": 803.5794067382812,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 580004140,
      "version": 319,
      "versionNonce": 1847052564,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787967686650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fanout on Read\n    - New Feed is generated during the read time(On demand model)\n    - Pros\n        - For Inactive users or those who rarely login fanout on read works better.\n        - No hot jey problem\n    - cons\n        - Fetch new feed is slow as it is not pre computed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fanout on Read\n    - New Feed is generated during the read time(On demand model)\n    - Pros\n        - For Inactive users or those who rarely login fanout on read works better.\n        - No hot jey problem\n    - cons\n        - Fetch new feed is slow as it is not pre computed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LrGuQ0weCZ-zb_1MCEo-G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4224.377947511547,
      "y": 2230.6914765058345,
      "width": 953.8395385742188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1573876012,
      "version": 174,
      "versionNonce": 1490114988,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787967796939,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Soln --> we choose the push model for majority of users \n           for people with many followers --> pull new content on demand to avoid system overload.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Soln --> we choose the push model for majority of users \n           for people with many followers --> pull new content on demand to avoid system overload.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jChklyzDqxSG4YDKytDsX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4231.785917375925,
      "y": 2371.4429039290276,
      "width": 981.219482421875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1440164140,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 535183660,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787967891910,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Consistent hashing helps to solve the hotkey problem as it helps to distribute the data more evenly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Consistent hashing helps to solve the hotkey problem as it helps to distribute the data more evenly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
